{
  "_comment": "Shared chart palette for every Foundry-rendered chart (spider, gauge, bar, heatmap, exposure map). Brand teal + the risk bands of governance/RISK_THRESHOLDS.md + a colour-blind-safe categorical set (dataviz method: one hue family per series, >= 3:1 contrast on white and on 0F172A). template-manager and output-verifier enforce colour/threshold consistency against this file.",
